            # the way a written-down plan does.
            #
            # `--json` emits the same scan machine-readably. Renderers (this
            # text view, a future webview) must consume THAT, never re-scrape:
            # duplicated scraping logic is exactly how `who` and `heal` drifted
            # apart until working agents read as idle for days.
            #
            # Planned work / sequencing: shown ONLY for agents that record it.
            # The original omission ("nothing in the system records intent,
            # a NEXT column would render empty forever", 2026-07-21) was
            # reversed 2026-07-25 by the bio convention — agents keep
            # "next: <one line>" in their hub bio, the heartbeat daemons parse
            # it into ~/.mcp-hub/fleet-board.json, and the NEXT section below
